(mass-harness)
*title Mass and CG table harness
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=0.0 y=0.0 z=0.0 xdt=0.0 ydt=0.0 zdt=0.0 time=0.0 mass=620.0
  *define stage
    stage = 1.0;
  *define config
    config = 1.0;
  *define mass_history
    mass_history = table(mass-history);
  *define cg_history
    cg_history = table(cg-history);
  *file mass.dat time mass_history cg_history cg
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.1
    *cg cg=(weight-cg)
    *when time>0.2 stop
*end
